spec: S02-17, S02-18, S02-31

delete is soft (hidden; Versions kept; any Member with write), restore undoes it, purge (owner)
removes it for good and reclaims blobs no other Version references — a blob shared with another
Document survives. (Since ticket 09 a Version also references its rendered HTML blob: purging
`lc` removes two blobs, its Markdown and its HTML; `gc-shared`/`gc-twin` share both.)

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push lc.md
lc	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p agent delete lc
lc	[..]	deleted

$ annotary -p rowan status lc
? 2
error: no Document "lc" — DOC is an id, a Name unique in the Vault, or the path to a pulled .md; `annotary list` shows Documents

$ annotary -p rowan delete lc
? 2
error: no Document "lc" — DOC is an id, a Name unique in the Vault, or the path to a pulled .md; `annotary list` shows Documents

$ annotary -p rowan list lc --deleted
[..]	lc	v1	-	0	[..]

$ annotary -p rowan versions lc.md
v1	@rowan	[..]	-	-

$ annotary -p rowan restore lc
lc	[..]	restored

$ annotary -p rowan restore lc
? 2
error: no Document "lc" — DOC is an id, a Name unique in the Vault, or the path to a pulled .md; `annotary list` shows Documents

$ annotary -p rowan status lc.md
lc	[..]	v1	action:-	open:0	mentions-me:0	seq:[..]

$ annotary -p rowan delete lc.md
lc	[..]	deleted

$ annotary -p agent purge lc
? 4
error: purge is owner-only — ask an owner (`annotary member list` shows who)

$ annotary -p rowan purge lc --json
purged lc ([..]) — 2 blobs removed
{"name":"lc","id":"[..]","state":"purged"}

$ annotary -p rowan show lc --deleted
? 2
error: no Document "lc" — DOC is an id, a Name unique in the Vault, or the path to a pulled .md; `annotary list` shows Documents

$ annotary -p rowan push lc.md
? 2
error: no Document [..] (from lc.annotary) — was it purged? `push --doc ID` rebinds; delete the Sidecar to create a new Document

$ annotary -p rowan push gc-shared.md
gc-shared	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan push gc-other/gc-twin.md
gc-twin	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan delete gc-shared
gc-shared	[..]	deleted

$ annotary -p rowan purge gc-shared
purged gc-shared ([..]) — 0 blobs removed
gc-shared	[..]	purged

$ annotary -p rowan pull gc-twin --out t
pull: 0 threads, 0 assets
gc-twin.md	gc-twin.annotary	v1

```
